s distort her record.","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/secoriea-turner-family-condemns-rick-jackson-ad/"},{"issue":"Health care and Medicaid","why":"Bottoms wants full Medicaid expansion and says Jackson profited from a broken health system, while Jackson backs a state waiver with work requirements.","src":"https://www.atlantanewsfirst.com/2026/09/17/bottoms-airs-first-true-attack-ad-linking-jackson-rigged-system/"},{"issue":"Data centers","why":"Bottoms calls for a pause on new data centers and questions Jackson's investments, while Jackson notes she approved a Midtown project with incentives.","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/georgia-governors-race-follow-along-as-the-candidates-debate-on-tuesday/"},{"issue":"Affordability and taxes","why":"Jackson says voters care about gas prices, bills and property taxes, while Bottoms pledges to repeal the state grocery tax.","src":"https://www.wabe.org/bottoms-faces-empty-podium-on-debate-stage-while-jackson-campaigns-with-kemp/"},{"issue":"Abortion","why":"Bottoms used the debate he skipped to press Jackson on how rape exceptions work under Georgia's six week ban, which his campaign says mischaracterizes him.","src":"https://www.wabe.org/bottoms-faces-empty-podium-on-debate-stage-while-jackson-campaigns-with-kemp/"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Bottoms reports 23 million dollar haul","date":"2026-10-22","what":"Bottoms raised 23.2 million dollars since August with big DGA help, though Jackson has bought 87 million dollars in general election airtime from mostly his own money.","helps":"mixed","kind":"national","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/keisha-lance-bottoms-fundraising/"},{"title":"AJC poll finds a dead heat","date":"2026-10-20","what":"Jackson led 46 to 45 among likely voters, with Bottoms ahead among independents and Democrats far more enthusiastic than Republicans.","helps":"mixed","kind":"national","src":"https://www.wsbtv.com/news/local/ajcuga-poll-bottoms-jackson-dead-heat-georgia-governor-race/76TN3NROXRG4HDILVYDUMJS4RQ/"},{"title":"Jackson keeps distance from Trump","date":"2026-10-20","what":"Jackson, who once promised to be Trump's favorite governor, skipped a Trump rally for a Cherokee County event and casts himself as Kemp's heir.","helps":"R","kind":"national","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/rick-jackson-has-outspent-keisha-lance-bottoms-but-democratic-enthusiasm-has-the-race-knotted/"},{"title":"Jackson skips Atlanta Press Club debate","date":"2026-10-12","what":"Bottoms debated an empty podium and called Jackson a coward, while Jackson campaigned with Kemp and said voters care about costs, not debates.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.wabe.org/bottoms-faces-empty-podium-on-debate-stage-while-jackson-campaigns-with-kemp/"},{"title":"Family condemns Jackson crime ad","date":"2026-10-08","what":"The family of Secoriea Turner asked Jackson to pull an ad using her mother's 911 call, and his campaign said it will keep highlighting Bottoms' record as mayor.","helps":"D","kind":"ad","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/secoriea-turner-family-condemns-rick-jackson-ad/"},{"title":"Lone debate clash over data centers","date":"2026-10-06","what":"Bottoms said Jackson cannot be trusted on data centers and tied him to Trump, and Jackson hit her public safety record and her own data center approvals.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/georgia-governors-race-follow-along-as-the-candidates-debate-on-tuesday/"},{"title":"Bottoms launches rigged system ad","date":"2026-09-17","what":"Bottoms' first on camera attack ad says Jackson made his fortune off a broken health system and touts her grocery tax repeal and Medicaid expansion.","helps":"D","kind":"ad","src":"https://www.atlantanewsfirst.com/2026/09/17/bottoms-airs-first-true-attack-ad-linking-jackson-rigged-system/"}],"events":[{"title":"Skip the televised debate","prompt":"The Atlanta Press Club debate is set on public TV, and the race is tied. Does the campaign show up, and how does it frame the choice?","issue":"other","src":"https://www.wabe.org/bottoms-faces-empty-podium-on-debate-stage-while-jackson-campaigns-with-kemp/","opts":[{"label":"Debate and hit absence","say":"Take the stage and call any no show a coward hiding from voters on a private jet.","pos":-0.5,"trump":-0.3,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Debate on the issues","say":"Show up and stick to a cost of living message without attacking the opponent's choice.","pos":0,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Skip for the trail","say":"Skip the debate and campaign with Gov. Kemp, saying voters ask about bills, not debates.","pos":0.6,"trump":0.2,"tone":"calm"}]},{"title":"Data center boom","prompt":"Data centers are spreading across Georgia and raising worries about power bills and water. What is the policy?","issue":"econ","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/georgia-governors-race-follow-along-as-the-candidates-debate-on-tuesday/","opts":[{"label":"Pause new projects","say":"Call for a pause on new data center construction until ratepayers are protected.","pos":-0.7,"trump":-0.3,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Make them pay their way","say":"Allow growth but require data centers to cover their own power and water costs.","pos":0,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Keep Georgia open","say":"Defend incentives as job creators and attack the opponent's past approvals as hypocrisy.","pos":0.7,"trump":0.3,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Atlanta crime record","prompt":"Ads are replaying crime from the 2020 unrest in Atlanta, and a victim's family has asked that one be pulled. How does the campaign handle public safety?","issue":"other","src":"https://www.ajc.com/politics/2026/10/secoriea-turner-family-condemns-rick-jackson-ad/","opts":[{"label":"Condemn the ad","say":"Stand with the family, call the ad exploitation and point to police hiring as mayor.","pos":-0.6,"trump":-0.4,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Own regrets, look ahead","say":"